    "purpose": "To preserve and propagate spiritual knowledge, cultural traditions, and moral values. The Puranas serve as living texts, making profound philosophical truths accessible through stories, parables, and allegories. They bridge the gap between abstract Vedic wisdom and everyday life, ensuring the continuity of dharma across generations.",
