    ],
    "unique_insights": "Unlike purely philosophical texts, the Puranas use stories to make spiritual wisdom accessible to all—regardless of age, education, or background. They are dynamic, evolving with society, and remain relevant by addressing contemporary issues through timeless archetypes. The Puranas are not just records of the past, but living guides for personal and collective transformation."
